            <p>We are not children playing in the sand, constructing castles to be washed away by the tide of popular opinion. We are the keepers of a legacy that predates the ink on your constitutions. The Divine Right is not merely a political theory; it is a cosmological truth. It is the recognition that the spirit must have a vessel, and the nation must have a Head.</p>

